# Invalid: absolute-ledger

A board's locations are relative to its root.

```json
{
  "stew": "2026-11-08-draft",
  "kind": "board",
  "name": "home",
  "supports": [
    "2026-11-08-draft"
  ],
  "bounds": [],
  "profiles": [
    "profiles/general.us"
  ],
  "default_profile": "general",
  "channels": [],
  "accelerators": 1,
  "unanswered_card": 600,
  "ledger": "/var/stew/ledger.jsonl"
}
```
